  "body": "As per https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-secure-contexts/issues/5#issuecomment-151737360 it seems that whenever we want to inherit one of origin, HTTPS state, CSP policy or document's URL, we want to inherit all of them. To make this a lot clearer and easier to audit it would be better if the text detailing this was located together in the same sections.\n",
